⏳
Panukat ng Modo ng Pag-aaral
=== start/en
¶I-click para magdagdag ng oras ng pag-aaral at panoorin ang panukat na magbago mula kalmado tungo sa nakatuon hanggang sa sobra-sobra.¶

¶The action stores the choice the user clicks, such as add or reset.¶/en
aksyon: Pagpipilian()

¶Study hours remembers the current number of study hours.
It starts at 0, then updates depends on the action the user selects.¶/en
studyHours:
	0 …
	∆ aksyon …
		aksyon = 'reset' ?
			0
			studyHours + 1

¶Explanation shows a visible instruction for the user.¶/en
paliwanag:
	'I-click ang “Magdagdag ng Oras ng Pag-aaral +1” para dagdagan ang iyong oras ng pag-aaral. I-click ang “I-reset” para magsimula ulit.'

¶Hours text shows how many hours the user has studied.¶/en
tekstongOras:
	'Nag-aral ka ng ' + studyHours → '' + ' oras.'

¶Mood chooses the message shown on the screen.
It uses conditional expressions to show Calm, Focus, or Overload mode.¶/en
mood:
	studyHours < 3 ?
		'🌿 MODONG KALMADO — i-click para magdagdag ng oras ng pag-aaral'
		studyHours < 6 ?
			'📚 MODONG NAKATUON — nasa produktibong sona ka!'
			'🔥 MODONG SOBRA-SOBRA — magpahinga at pindutin ang "i-reset"'

¶Stage creates the visible scene.
The Stack places the title, explanation, number display, message, and selectable text controls vertically.¶/en
Entablado(
	[
		Grupo(
			Patongpatong()
			[
				Parirala('Panukat ng Modo ng Pag-aaral' laki: 0.5m)

				¶This Phrase shows the explanation on the screen.¶/en
				Parirala(paliwanag laki: 0.4m)

				¶This Phrase shows the current number of study hours.¶/en
				Parirala(tekstongOras laki: 0.4m)

				Parirala(mood laki: 0.75m)

				Grupo(
					Hilera(padding: 3m)
					[
						¶This selectable Phrase lets the user add one study hour.
						Its name is add, so selecting it updates the action choice.¶/en
						Parirala(
							'Magdagdag ng Oras ng Pag-aaral +1'
							mapipili: ⊤
							pangalan: 'idagdag'
							kulay: Kulay(80% 45 0°)
						)

						¶This selectable Phrase lets the user reset the tracker.
						Its name is reset, so selecting it sets study hours back to 0.¶/en
						Parirala(
							'I-reset'
							mapipili: ⊤
							pangalan: 'reset'
							kulay: Kulay(69% 47 271°)
						)
					]
				)
			]
			mukha: "Aclonica"
		)
	]
)